    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if \"rediscovery\" is even possible. it feels more like the person who actually lived my life is just... gone. like the soul of me left when they did. i look in the mirror and i dont recognize the eyes looking back. it's just this hollow shell that keeps going through the motions so i dont get evicted or something. it's frustrating because there's nothing left to find.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
