      "role": "user",
      "content": "sensations... i dont know. it just feels like a chore to even breathe sometimes. like i'm just performing being human for nobody. if the person i actually was is gone, then what is the point of this shells staying around? it feels so heavy and purposeless. i just feel like a mistake that hasn't been corrected yet.",
